type: software
title: "free-quantum: A strict formalization of Πk in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A strict formalization in Lean 4 / Mathlib of Πk, the free model of
  reversible quantum computing from "Free quantum computing" (Carette et al.,
  PNAS 2026), with the two-qubit Quantum Schur Transform as a case study.
